---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="NCC-Forces | Defence Aspirant Club">
  <main>
    <section class="border-t border-line px-5 py-18">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl reveal">
        <p class="eyebrow">---The Forces---</p>
        <h2>About NCC and the Defence Forces</h2>
        <p>
          The National Cadet Corps (NCC) is a youth organisation with Army, Naval and Air Wings that builds discipline, leadership, teamwork and confidence through drills, camps, adventure and military training. With the motto “Unity and Discipline,” cadets can earn A, B and C Certificates, with the ‘C’ Certificate offering benefits in certain defence entries, including opportunities through NCC Special Entry. 
        </p>
        <div class="card-grid">
          <div class="card">
            <h3>Indian Army</h3>
            <p>
              The land-based force protecting India's borders. Major entry routes include NDA, CDS, TES, TGC, SSC Tech and NCC Special Entry.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <h3>Indian Navy</h3>
            <p>
              The maritime force safeguarding India's maritime interests. Major
              entry routes include NDA, 10+2 B.Tech, CDS, SSC and NCC Special
              Entry.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <h3>Indian Air Force</h3>
            <p>
              The force responsible for protecting India's airspace. Major entry
              routes include NDA, AFCAT, CDS and NCC Special Entry.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <h3>Defence Carrers</h3>
            <p>
              Choose an entry based on your education, age, eligibility and
              interests. Always check the latest official notification before
              applying.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
